MB*9ShRTv6vpY74rx',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,68,'pjs@kingdisplay.com',0,'2019-08-28 17:46:50',NULL,'pop'),(276,'刘伟莲 <lwl@kingdisplay.com>','pingdi.list <pingdi.list@kingdisplay.net.cn>,销售群<xiaoshou.list@kingdisplay.com>,销售助理<xszl.list@kingdisplay.com>,徐士领<xushiling@kingdisplay.com>,万纯<wanchun@kingdisplay.net.cn>','熊华 <xh@kingdisplay.com>,夏锦芳<xjf@kingdisplay.com>,杜建新<dujianxin@kingdisplay.com>,陈思容<csr@kingdisplay.net.cn>,阮杜娟<ruandujuan@kingdisplay.net.cn>,梁宇东<lyd1@kingdisplay.net.cn>',NULL,'2019-08-27 15:09:14','【非常重要】海关AEO关务系统9月1日正式上线','<html><head><meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=GB2312\"><style>body { line-height: 1.5; }blockquote { margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0.5em; }p { margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; }body { font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; }body { font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; }</style></head><body>\n<div><span></span><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px;\">Dear All,</b></div><div><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;海关AEO高级认证</b><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">TCS</b><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">关务系统针对销售助理、采购收单人（徐士领），于8月27日上午已完成</b><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">系统操作培训</b><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">。 &nbsp;</b></div><div><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></div><div><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</b><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">于2019年9月1日正式启用TCS关务系统，此系统目前只用于“深圳国显科技有限公司\"所有美元交易需要进出口报关操作。</b></div><div><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; &nbsp;注意：</font></b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、采购：所有采购资料递交流程按原先执行，不作改动，（所有采购把资料给到徐士领）。</font></b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;徐士领： 统一上传关务系统。</font></b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、销售助理：</font></b><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#333333\">所有出口资料递交流程按原先执行，增加资料上传关务系统动作。</font></b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; （出口模版表格，装箱单、</font></b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、资料一旦上传系统，不可做任何改变。</font></b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、TCS关务系统，浏览器统一使用：</font><font color=\"#ff0000\">谷歌、搜狐</font></b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</font>5、TCS关务系统网址：192.168.16.132</b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6、见附件：操作流程PPT</b></div><div><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;7、见附件：</b><b style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; background-color: transparent;\">数据导入电子表格模版</b></div>\n<div><br></div><hr style=\"width: 210px; height: 1px;\" color=\"#b5c4df\" size=\"1\" align=\"left\">\n<div><span><div style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10px; MARGIN-LEFT: 10px; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10px\">\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><em><span style=\"FONT-STYLE: normal; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><em><span style=\"FONT-STYLE: normal; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal\"></span></em></span></span></span></font></span></em></span></span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" size=\"1\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><em style=\"FONT-STYLE: normal; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 6.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal\">\n<div st